          "v": "A patchy or sparse beard can come down to genetics, scarring or a medical condition. When grooming and shaving habits do not help, some men consider a beard transplant. This guide explains what the procedure involves, who it may suit, what recovery looks like and what affects the cost, so you can decide whether it is worth exploring further."
